velopment\",\n      \"tech stack\",\n      \"programming workflows\"\n    ],\n    \"type\": \"tutorial\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"Here's how I use LLMs to help me write code\",\n    \"description\": \"Discusses the challenges and unintuitive nature of using LLMs for coding. Explores how to effectively leverage LLMs as complementary tools rather than replacements. Simon emphasizes practical LLM integration in developer workflows.\",\n    \"author\": \"Simon Willison\",\n    \"source\": \"Blog\",\n    \"url\": \"https://simonwillison.net/2025/Mar/11/using-llms-for-code/\",\n    \"published_date\": \"2025-03-11\",\n    \"topics\": [\n      \"LLM coding\",\n      \"developer workflow\",\n      \"AI-assisted development\"\n    ],\n    \"type\": \"tutorial\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"Enhancing LLM Code Generation through Test-Driven Development\",\n    \"description\": \"ArXiv paper on improving LLM code generation capabilities using TDD methodologies, reflecting growing emphasis on practical improvement techniques for code LLMs.\",\n    \"author\": \"ArXiv Researchers\",\n    \"source\": \"ArXiv\",\n    \"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2511.12823\",\n    \"published_date\": \"2025-03-10\",\n    \"topics\": [\n      \"code generation\",\n      \"TDD\",\n      \"LLM improvement\",\n      \"practical techniques\"\n    ],\n    \"type\": \"technical\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"Increasing LLM Coding Capabilities through Diverse Synthetic Data\",\n    \"description\": \"ArXiv paper tackling the limitation of progress in code generation due to data shortages by using diverse synthetic data to boost model performance.\",\n    \"author\": \"ArXiv Researchers\",\n    \"source\": \"ArXiv\",\n    \"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.23208\",\n    \"published_date\": \"2025-03-09\",\n    \"topics\": [\n      \"code generation\",\n      \"synthetic data\",\n      \"LLM training\",\n      \"data augmentation\"\n    ],\n    \"type\": \"technical\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"